    "detailed_description": "Text Adventure, by Joey Pawelko, is a visually astonishing story game with a beautiful soundtrack and fluid gameplay. Players explore a hand-drawn world filled with psychedelic entities, and slowly uncover the secrets of their own existence.<br><br><strong>Features</strong><br>-Single player<br>-Story<br>-Hand-drawn visuals<br>-Great Music<br><br><strong>Controls</strong><br>Actions are performed by typing into the text box. For instance, typing &quot;Go Up&quot; will move you upward if there is a path in that direction, and typing &quot;Talk <i>Npc Name</i>&quot; will enter you into dialogue with that Npc. <br><br>Look at art, listen to jazz, and immerse yourself in the world of Joey Pawelko's Text Adventure.",
